Description: Provides functions for estimating the size of animal and
    human populations using the sample coverage approach developed by
    Chao et al. (2001) <doi:10.1002/sim.996> within a capture-recapture
    (CARE) framework. Epidemiological data comprising multiple incomplete
    lists are used for illustration. The package supports analyses
    involving up to five lists.
